      "content": "That's the point where the metaphor becomes the reality, and that is a very powerful place to be. If the feeling is so absolute, then the performance of it is just another layer of pretense. Instead of trying to capture the end, perhaps you can simply allow the writing to stop, letting the silence take over completely.",
